---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import { supabase } from '../lib/supabase/client';

// Ambil data program magang aktif dari Supabase
const { data: programsData, error: progErr } = await supabase
  .from('programs')
  .select('id, title, slug, category, target_major, short_description, mode, duration, sort_order')
  .eq('is_published', true)
  .order('sort_order', { ascending: true });

// Ambil data layanan jasa digital dari Supabase
const { data: servicesData, error: servErr } = await supabase
  .from('services')
  .select('id, title, slug, short_description, icon, sort_order')
  .eq('is_published', true)
  .order('sort_order', { ascending: true });

const programs = programsData || [];
const services = servicesData || [];

const smkPrograms = programs.filter(p => p.category === 'smk');
const collegePrograms = programs.filter(p => p.category === 'mahasiswa');

// JSON-LD Structured Data Schema untuk Beranda (Sesuai PRD Bab 10.2)
const homeSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "@id": "https://programmagang.id/#organization",
      "name": "Program Magang SMK, Mahasiswa & Digital Agency",
      "url": "https://programmagang.id/",
      "telephone": "+62895639068080",
      "description": "Program magang terpadu SMK dan mahasiswa serta layanan digital marketing, SEO, social media marketing, dan web development."
    },
    {
      "@type": "WebSite",
      "@id": "https://programmagang.id/#website",
      "url": "https://programmagang.id/",
      "name": "Program Magang & Digital Agency",
      "publisher": {
        "@id": "https://programmagang.id/#organization"
      },
      "inLanguage": "id-ID"
    }
  ]
};
---

<MainLayout
  title="Program Magang SMK & Mahasiswa dan Jasa Digital Agency"
  description="Temukan tempat magang PKL SMK (RPL, TKJ, Multimedia, DKV) dan magang mahasiswa (Informatika, Digital Marketing, Bisnis Digital). Dapatkan portofolio nyata dan bimbingan mentor industri!"
  schema={homeSchema}
>
  <!-- 1. HERO SECTION -->
  <section class="py-5 py-lg-6 position-relative overflow-hidden" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #F8F6F5 100%);">
    <div class="container py-4">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2 badge-maroon mb-3 px-3 py-2">
            <i class="bi bi-patch-check-fill text-maroon"></i>
            <span class="small fw-semibold">Pendaftaran Periode Magang & PKL Aktif</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold font-heading text-maroon mb-3 lh-sm">
            Bangun Skill Digital, Kembangkan Potensi, dan Siapkan Karier Masa Depan.
          </h1>

          <p class="lead text-muted mb-4 fs-5" style="max-width: 600px;">
            Program magang intensif untuk siswa SMK dan mahasiswa. Dapatkan pengalaman praktis menangani proyek nyata di bidang teknologi web, digital marketing, bisnis digital, dan industri kreatif.
          </p>

          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <a href="/pendaftaran" class="btn btn-maroon btn-lg px-4 d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2 shadow-sm">
              <span>Daftar Program Magang</span>
              <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://wa.me/62895639068080?text=Halo%2C%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20mengenai%20program%20magang%20dan%20PKL"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn btn-outline-maroon btn-lg px-4 d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2"
            >
              <i class="bi bi-whatsapp text-success fs-5"></i>
              <span>Konsultasi via WhatsApp</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Trust Badges -->
          <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-4 pt-3 border-top border-secondary border-opacity-10 small text-muted">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-maroon"></i>
              <span>Sertifikat Magang Resmi</span>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-maroon"></i>
              <span>Proyek Nyata & Portofolio</span>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
              <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-maroon"></i>
              <span>Bimbingan Mentor Praktisi</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <div class="position-relative">
            <!-- Decorative Accent Box -->
            <div class="card-elegant p-4 p-md-5 border-0 text-white position-relative shadow-lg" style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, #651D32 0%, #8A3049 100%);">
              <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start mb-4">
                <div>
                  <span class="badge bg-white text-maroon fw-bold mb-2">Pusat Inkubasi Digital</span>
                  <h3 class="h4 text-white fw-bold mb-1">Siap Jadi Talenta Digital Siap Kerja?</h3>
                </div>
                <i class="bi bi-laptop fs-1 opacity-75"></i>
              </div>

              <p class="text-light opacity-90 small mb-4">
                Bukan sekadar magang formalitas. Anda akan belajar ekosistem kerja nyata, menggunakan tools modern industri, dan menyelesaikan tantangan riil bersama tim digital agency.
              </p>

              <div class="row g-3 text-center mb-4">
                <div class="col-6">
                  <div class="bg-white bg-opacity-10 rounded-3 p-3">
                    <span class="d-block fs-3 fw-bold text-white">8+</span>
                    <span class="small text-light opacity-75">Bidang Jurusan</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-6">
                  <div class="bg-white bg-opacity-10 rounded-3 p-3">
                    <span class="d-block fs-3 fw-bold text-white">100%</span>
                    <span class="small text-light opacity-75">Studi Kasus Riil</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <a href="/tentang-kami" class="btn btn-light text-maroon fw-bold w-100 py-2">
                Pelajari Tentang Kami &rarr;
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. STATS & OVERVIEW STRIP -->
  <section class="py-4 bg-white border-top border-bottom">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-4 text-center">
        <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
          <h4 class="fs-2 fw-bold text-maroon mb-1 font-heading">SMK & MHS</h4>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Terbuka Untuk Siswa & Mahasiswa</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
          <h4 class="fs-2 fw-bold text-maroon mb-1 font-heading">Hybrid / Online</h4>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Fleksibilitas Pelaksanaan</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
          <h4 class="fs-2 fw-bold text-maroon mb-1 font-heading">Proyek Nyata</h4>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Bangun Portofolio Kredibel</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
          <h4 class="fs-2 fw-bold text-maroon mb-1 font-heading">Surat Resmi</h4>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Dukungan Administrasi Sekolah/Kampus</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. PROGRAM MAGANG UNGGULAN -->
  <section class="section-padding" id="program">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <span class="badge-maroon px-3 py-1 mb-2 d-inline-block">Pilihan Spesialisasi</span>
        <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold font-heading text-maroon mb-3">Pilihan Program Magang & PKL</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mx-auto" style="max-width: 650px;">
          Kurikulum dirancang selaras dengan kebutuhan dunia usaha dan industri digital saat ini. Pilih jalur yang sesuai dengan jurusan dan minat keahlian Anda.
        </p>

        <!-- Category Tabs Navigation -->
        <ul class="nav nav-pills justify-content-center gap-2 mt-4" id="programTabs" role="tablist">
          <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
            <button class="nav-link active btn-maroon px-4 rounded-pill" id="smk-tab" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#smk-content" type="button" role="tab">
              <i class="bi bi-mortarboard me-1"></i> Program SMK / PKL ({smkPrograms.length})
            </button>
          </li>
          <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
            <button class="nav-link btn-outline-maroon px-4 rounded-pill" id="mahasiswa-tab" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#mahasiswa-content" type="button" role="tab">
              <i class="bi bi-person-workspace me-1"></i> Program Mahasiswa ({collegePrograms.length})
            </button>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-content" id="programTabsContent">
        <!-- SMK Tab Pane -->
        <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="smk-content" role="tabpanel">
          <div class="row g-4">
            {smkPrograms.map((prog) => (
              <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
                <div class="card-elegant h-100 p-4 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between position-relative">
                  <div>
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
                      <span class="badge bg-maroon text-white fw-medium px-2 py-1 small">{prog.target_major || 'SMK'}</span>
                      <small class="text-muted"><i class="bi bi-clock me-1"></i>{prog.duration || '3 Bulan'}</small>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 font-heading fs-6">
                      <a href={`/program/${prog.slug}`} class="text-decoration-none text-maroon stretched-link">
                        {prog.title}
                      </a>
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
                      {prog.short_description || 'Pelajari praktik dan implementasi langsung di bawah bimbingan mentor berpengalaman.'}
                    </p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="pt-3 border-top d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <span class="badge badge-outline text-capitalize">{prog.mode}</span>
                    <span class="text-maroon fw-semibold small">Detail &rarr;</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mahasiswa Tab Pane -->
        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="mahasiswa-content" role="tabpanel">
          <div class="row g-4">
            {collegePrograms.map((prog) => (
              <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
                <div class="card-elegant h-100 p-4 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between position-relative">
                  <div>
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
                      <span class="badge bg-secondary text-white fw-medium px-2 py-1 small">{prog.target_major || 'Kuliah'}</span>
                      <small class="text-muted"><i class="bi bi-clock me-1"></i>{prog.duration || '4-6 Bulan'}</small>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="fw-bold mb-2 font-heading fs-6">
                      <a href={`/program/${prog.slug}`} class="text-decoration-none text-maroon stretched-link">
                        {prog.title}
                      </a>
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
                      {prog.short_description || 'Eksplorasi proyek nyata, arsitektur software, dan strategi digital modern.'}
                    </p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="pt-3 border-top d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <span class="badge badge-outline text-capitalize">{prog.mode}</span>
                    <span class="text-maroon fw-semibold small">Detail &rarr;</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-5">
        <a href="/program" class="btn btn-outline-maroon px-4 py-2">
          Lihat Seluruh Informasi & Kurikulum Program &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4. LAYANAN DIGITAL AGENCY -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-white" id="jasa">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <span class="badge-maroon px-3 py-1 mb-2 d-inline-block">Layanan Bisnis & UMKM</span>
        <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold font-heading text-maroon mb-3">Solusi Digital Agency Profesional</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mx-auto" style="max-width: 650px;">
          Kami juga membantu para pelaku usaha, UMKM, dan perusahaan meningkatkan visibilitas digital, performa penjualan online, dan citra merek.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-4">
        {services.map((svc) => (
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
            <div class="card-elegant h-100 p-4 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between">
              <div>
                <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-accent-soft text-maroon rounded-3 p-3 mb-3" style="width: 52px; height: 52px;">
                  <i class={`bi ${svc.icon || 'bi-briefcase'} fs-4`}></i>
                </div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold text-maroon mb-2 font-heading">{svc.title}</h5>
                <p class="text-muted small mb-4">
                  {svc.short_description}
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="pt-3 border-top d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                <a href={`/jasa/${svc.slug}`} class="text-maroon fw-semibold small text-decoration-none">
                  Pelajari Layanan &rarr;
                </a>
                <a
                  href={`https://wa.me/62895639068080?text=Halo%2C%20saya%20tertarik%20dengan%20layanan%20${encodeURIComponent(svc.title)}`}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-maroon"
                >
                  <i class="bi bi-whatsapp"></i> Chat
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5. WHY CHOOSE US (KEUNGGULAN) -->
  <section class="section-padding" style="background-color: #F8F6F5;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <span class="badge-maroon px-3 py-1 mb-2 d-inline-block">Nilai Tambah Kami</span>
        <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold font-heading text-maroon mb-3">Mengapa Magang Bersama Kami?</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mx-auto" style="max-width: 600px;">
          Kami menjamin pengalaman magang yang berbobot, edukatif, dan berdampak nyata bagi portofolio karier Anda.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="card-elegant p-4 h-100 text-center">
            <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-maroon text-white rounded-circle mx-auto mb-3" style="width: 60px; height: 60px;">
              <i class="bi bi-tools fs-4"></i>
            </div>
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-maroon mb-2">Bukan Sekadar Teori</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Peserta mengerjakan tugas riil, menggunakan teknologi modern, dan menghadapi masalah nyata industri.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="card-elegant p-4 h-100 text-center">
            <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-maroon text-white rounded-circle mx-auto mb-3" style="width: 60px; height: 60px;">
              <i class="bi bi-person-check fs-4"></i>
            </div>
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-maroon mb-2">Mentor Berpengalaman</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Bimbingan intensif dan evaluasi berkala untuk memastikan akselerasi kemampuan Anda tercapai.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="card-elegant p-4 h-100 text-center">
            <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-maroon text-white rounded-circle mx-auto mb-3" style="width: 60px; height: 60px;">
              <i class="bi bi-journal-album fs-4"></i>
            </div>
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-maroon mb-2">Portofolio Kredibel</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Setiap peserta menyelesaikan karya terukur yang siap dimasukkan ke dalam CV dan akun LinkedIn.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="card-elegant p-4 h-100 text-center">
            <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-maroon text-white rounded-circle mx-auto mb-3" style="width: 60px; height: 60px;">
              <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-check fs-4"></i>
            </div>
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-maroon mb-2">Sertifikat & Penilaian</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Sertifikat kelulusan resmi dan lembar penilaian formatif untuk kebutuhan kampus atau sekolah.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6. ALUR PENDAFTARAN -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <span class="badge-maroon px-3 py-1 mb-2 d-inline-block">Langkah Mudah</span>
        <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold font-heading text-maroon mb-3">Alur Pendaftaran Magang</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mx-auto" style="max-width: 600px;">
          Proses pendaftaran cepat, transparan, dan tercatat otomatis ke sistem database.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-4 text-center">
        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="p-3">
            <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-accent-soft text-maroon fw-bold rounded-circle mb-3 fs-4" style="width: 56px; height: 56px;">
              1
            </div>
            <h6 class="fw-bold text-maroon mb-2 font-heading">Pilih Program</h6>
            <p class="text-muted small">Pilih bidang magang yang sesuai dengan jurusan SMK atau program studi kuliah Anda.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="p-3">
            <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-accent-soft text-maroon fw-bold rounded-circle mb-3 fs-4" style="width: 56px; height: 56px;">
              2
            </div>
            <h6 class="fw-bold text-maroon mb-2 font-heading">Isi Formulir Online</h6>
            <p class="text-muted small">Lengkapi data diri, asal institusi, durasi magang, serta lampirkan link portofolio / CV.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="p-3">
            <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-accent-soft text-maroon fw-bold rounded-circle mb-3 fs-4" style="width: 56px; height: 56px;">
              3
            </div>
            <h6 class="fw-bold text-maroon mb-2 font-heading">Dapatkan Nomor Registrasi</h6>
            <p class="text-muted small">Sistem menghasilkan kode registrasi unik sebagai bukti pendaftaran resmi.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="p-3">
            <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-accent-soft text-maroon fw-bold rounded-circle mb-3 fs-4" style="width: 56px; height: 56px;">
              4
            </div>
            <h6 class="fw-bold text-maroon mb-2 font-heading">Konfirmasi WhatsApp</h6>
            <p class="text-muted small">Lanjutkan konfirmasi langsung via WhatsApp admin untuk proses seleksi dan wawancara.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-4">
        <a href="/pendaftaran" class="btn btn-maroon btn-lg px-4">
          Buka Formulir Pendaftaran Sekarang &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 7. FAQ ACCORDION -->
  <section class="section-padding" style="background-color: #F8F6F5;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <span class="badge-maroon px-3 py-1 mb-2 d-inline-block">Pertanyaan Umum</span>
        <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold font-heading text-maroon mb-3">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">Jawaban cepat atas pertanyaan yang sering diajukan calon peserta.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="accordion border-0 shadow-sm rounded-3 overflow-hidden" id="faqAccordion">
        <div class="accordion-item border-bottom">
          <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq1">
            <button class="accordion-button fw-semibold text-maroon" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapse1">
              Siapa saja yang boleh mendaftar program magang ini?
            </button>
          </h2>
          <div id="collapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="faq1" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-body text-muted small">
              Program ini terbuka untuk siswa SMK aktif (jurusan RPL, TKJ, Multimedia, DKV) yang membutuhkan tempat PKL, serta mahasiswa tingkat diploma maupun sarjana dari jurusan Informatika, Sistem Informasi, Digital Marketing, Bisnis Digital, Manajemen, dan bidang terkait.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item border-bottom">
          <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq2">
            <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold text-maroon" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse2">
              Bagaimana metode pelaksanaan magang (Online / Offline)?
            </button>
          </h2>
          <div id="collapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faq2" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-body text-muted small">
              Pelaksanaan magang didesain fleksibel dengan metode <strong>Hybrid</strong> dan <strong>Remote/Online</strong>, sehingga peserta dari luar kota atau wilayah lain tetap dapat mengikuti seluruh kurikulum dan berkolaborasi secara optimal.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item border-bottom">
          <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq3">
            <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold text-maroon" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse3">
              Apakah peserta akan mendapatkan sertifikat resmi?
            </button>
          </h2>
          <div id="collapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faq3" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-body text-muted small">
              Ya, seluruh peserta yang menyelesaikan periode magang dengan baik dan memenuhi standar evaluasi proyek akan memperoleh Sertifikat Magang Resmi beserta lembar penilaian performa kerja untuk sekolah/kampus.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

